83
00:13:31,669 --> 00:13:35,323
The cause of death was indeed fire,
but where did the fire come from?

84
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:40,378
We didn't find any fuel that could cause the fire
to spread throughout the body to that extent.

85
00:13:43,043 --> 00:13:43,880
May I have your permission?

86
00:13:44,338 --> 00:13:45,796
The victim's phone has been unlocked.

87
00:13:46,116 --> 00:13:46,934
