164
00:21:33,545 --> 00:21:34,236
Nisa.

165
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,640
Nisa!

166
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,520
Nisa.

167
00:21:45,580 --> 00:21:46,480
Nisa.

