527
01:04:28,720 --> 01:04:31,618
Sky, let him in. He has a warrant.

528
01:04:31,694 --> 01:04:32,974
He'll be gone in a minute, honey.

529
01:04:33,312 --> 01:04:37,061
No, no. My mother taught me
not to let strangers into the house.

530
01:04:37,716 --> 01:04:41,629
Officer, Officer, Officer,
please take your friends out.

531
01:04:41,720 --> 01:04:43,487
- Take them out.
- Sky

532
01:04:44,509 --> 01:04:45,443
Sky, listen to me.

533
01:04:46,705 --> 01:04:47,829
I need to do it.

534
01:04:48,309 --> 01:04:49,967
I would like permission to search your bedroom.

535
01:04:50,380 --> 01:04:53,127
No, no, no, the police are not allowed
to enter my bedroom!

536
01:04:53,178 --> 01:04:56,410
How can you enter my bedroom, Officer?

537
01:04:57,327 --> 01:04:59,476
Do not enter my bedroom, Officer.

538
01:05:00,818 --> 01:05:03,538
Please, Officer. Please!

539
01:05:03,600 --> 01:05:04,400
Split up and search!

540
01:05:04,625 --> 01:05:07,414
- Don't touch my child.
- Officer!

541
01:05:15,160 --> 01:05:16,000
Sky.

542
01:05:17,240 --> 01:05:18,040
Sky.

543
01:06:50,781 --> 01:06:53,360
Hello, my name is Pilanthorn.

544
01:06:54,032 --> 01:06:54,818
I am a police officer.

545
01:06:55,425 --> 01:06:56,200
Hello.

546
01:06:56,454 --> 01:06:59,523
My name is Sky.
S-K-Y means the space above the Earth.

547
01:07:03,832 --> 01:07:05,480
Sky, Sky, Sky.

548
01:07:07,120 --> 01:07:08,567
You can step back a bit.

549
01:07:08,883 --> 01:07:11,909
If you walk close to me like this,
other people will think that you are my boyfriend.

550
01:07:12,112 --> 01:07:13,443
Not good. Not good.

551
01:07:14,400 --> 01:07:15,040
Sky.

552
01:07:31,996 --> 01:07:34,850
The Officer is not a stranger,
not just an acquaintance.

553
01:07:35,036 --> 01:07:39,236
The Officer saved Sky's life,
so Sky considers you as a friend.

554
01:07:41,600 --> 01:07:43,061
Sky gives Officer the lollipop.

555
01:07:43,785 --> 01:07:45,770
Thank you for saving me.
